{#
    The row on top of every list, the same on each: its view tabs on the left and, on the right of the
    same row with one rail under both, its tools (_list_tools): the search field, the Filter icon and
    the Settings icon (Shopify Polaris IndexFilters puts search and filter on the row of view tabs,
    Linear its display options at the end of its view bar). The views past the tabs are in the
    Settings sheet, so the row has no menu of them; one of those opened shows as a tab while it is.
    Takes:
    - toolbarTabs: the tabs, as Ui:Tabs takes them, or none on a list without views;
    - toolbarMore: the views past the tabs, of which only the one shown is a tab;
    - toolbarLabel: the accessible name of the tabs;
    - toolbarTabsAttributes: more attributes of the tabs, such as a data- hook;
    and what _list_tools takes.
#}
{% set toolbarItems = (toolbarTabs ?? [])|merge((toolbarMore ?? [])|filter(item => item.active ?? false)) %}
<div class="relative flex min-w-0 items-center gap-x-4 inset-shadow-rail" data-list-toolbar>
    {% if toolbarItems is not empty %}
        {{ component('Ui:Tabs', {items: toolbarItems, label: toolbarLabel ?? null, rail: false, class: 'min-w-0 flex-1'}|merge(toolbarTabsAttributes ?? {})) }}
    {% else %}
        <div class="min-h-control flex-1 max-shell:min-h-touch" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    {% endif %}
    {{ include('@Ui/components/_list_tools.html.twig') }}
</div>
